01:06:48.570 --> 01:06:56.890
<v Dan Hardman>My desire to have this club succeed is just humongous. I mean, anything goes wrong with this club, I feel it's a part of me.
<v Dan Hardman>我希望这个俱乐部成功的欲望太巨大了。我的意思是，这个俱乐部出任何问题，我都觉得这是我的一部分。

